Anatomy assets — licence and attribution
========================================

The GLB files in this directory (body.glb, organs.glb, heart.glb) are DERIVED WORKS of the
BodyParts3D dataset. They are NOT covered by the MIT licence that covers the rest of this
repository. They are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-Share Alike 2.1 Japan, the
same terms as the source.

